{"unit_id":"EYADAGHARIRE__dsh-plugin-delete-chat#feature-1","repo":"EYADAGHARIRE/dsh-plugin-delete-chat","commit":"5e0d82beb92d1bc0688da4bdc2dd15809b430978","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Delete chat 的功能「侧边栏删除会话」：在会话行菜单显示删除入口，点击后请求确认；确认时通过 Host 删除本机的会话目录和派生缓存记录，并通知界面移除该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:148-164","client.js:237-255","index.js:176-187","index.js:297-306"]}
